<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title><%= title %></title>
<style><%== css %></style>
<% styles.each do |style| %><style><%== style %></style>
<% end %>
</head>
<body data-stamp="<%= stamp %>"<% if ledger %> data-page="ledger"<% end %>>
<% if skip %><a class="skip-link" href="#waiting">Skip to waiting work</a><% end %>
<main>
<%== body %>
<p class="live-note">Rebuilt from the journal on every request; the index reloads when a ledger changes, a ledger page says so and waits for you. What you send goes to the ledger's inbox, never into the ledger: its session files it there.</p>
</main>
<% if live %><script><%== js %></script><% end %>
</body>
</html>
